{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"p\">\n  <parallel id=\"p\" final>\n    <state id=\"r1\"><transition event=\"done\" target=\"end\"/></state>\n    <state id=\"r2\"/>\n  </parallel>\n  <final id=\"end\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-attribute-without-value.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-attribute-without-value.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":6,"byteOffset":92,"endColumn":25,"endLine":2,"startColumn":19,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove `final`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-attribute-without-value.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":25,"endLine":2,"startColumn":20,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"attribute `final` on `<parallel>` has no value\n\n**Note:** SCXML documents must be well-formed XML 1.0 with namespaces; no later validation runs until parsing succeeds\n\n**Help:** SCXML has no `final` attribute: a final state is the element `<final id=\"…\"/>`; remove `final`, and write the state as `<final>` if it is meant to end its parent\n\n**Spec:** XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §2.1 Well-Formed XML Documents","text":"attribute `final` on `<parallel>` has no value"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":98,"start":93},"category":"syntax"},"ruleId":"XML001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML is an XML vocabulary; until the document parses, no schema or semantic rule can run"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: fix the XML syntax at the marked position: remove Markdown code fences or prose outside the single root element, keep `<?xml …?>` at the very start, escape `<` as `&lt;` and `&` as `&amp;` in attribute values and text (or use `<![CDATA[ … ]]>` in `<script>`), close or rename mismatched tags, quote attribute values, specify each attribute once, and never write `--` inside a comment.\n\nSpecification: XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §2.1 Well-Formed XML Documents\n\nRun `scx --explain XML001` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-well-formed","id":"XML001","name":"XML001","properties":{"category":"syntax"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the document is not well-formed XML"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}